Scottish Quakeworld player and developer, who more and more moved away from playing to helping out contributing to development of [[ezQuake]] among other projects. Blamed his 33.6k modem connection for as long as he could, then got a janet connection in 1999 and had to start blaming his aim instead.

== Contributions ==
* Member of [[ezQuake]] team since 2015, focusing on demo/qtv playback
* Primary mvdsv/ktx/qtv developer since 2016, creating simultaneous race mode and integrating the [[frogbot]] mod.
* Admin of badplace.eu quake servers, creator of [https://badplace.eu badplace.eu] demo/tournament archive website


